# The gateway reads no setting from the environment. Its two surface settings — the directory of
# `<dataset>.db` files and the base URL images are addressed from — are `create_app` parameters whose
# defaults already hold the live values, so moving either is a code change rather than a variable.
#
# systemd still hands ~/.config/biohack-gateway/env to the process through `EnvironmentFile=`, but
# only as a state file that must exist; nothing in the gateway reads it today. Add a name here when a
# setting reads one, never a value.
#
# Where that directory and its tree come from: deploy/README.md §1.5.
